## 🎯 EJEMPLOS RÁPIDOS

### ✅ CORRECTO

**Controller delgado:**
```php
public function index()
{
    $orders = app(OrderService::class)->getRecent();
    return view('orders.index', compact('orders'));
}
```

**Model con trait:**
```php
use App\Shared\Traits\BelongsToTenant;

class Order extends Model
{
    use BelongsToTenant; // ✅ CRÍTICO
}
```

**Query con eager loading:**
```php
Order::with(['items.product', 'customer'])->get(); // ✅
```

### ❌ INCORRECTO

**Lógica en controller:**
```php
public function index()
{
    $orders = Order::where(...)->get()->map(...); // ❌
}
```

**Sin trait:**
```php
class Order extends Model { } // ❌ Cruza tenants
```

**N+1 query:**
```php
$orders = Order::all();
foreach($orders as $order) {
    $order->items; // ❌ Query por cada iteración
}
```

