## 📝 CONVENCIONES

**Naming:**
- Controllers: `ProductController` (singular + Controller)
- Services: `ProductService` (singular + Service)
- Models: `Product` (singular)
- Variables PHP: `$orderNumber` (camelCase)
- Métodos: `procesarImagen()` (camelCase, español)
- Rutas: `/admin/productos` (kebab-case, español)
- Archivos Blade: `product-list.blade.php` (kebab-case)

**Estructura Vertical Slicing:**
```
app/Features/[Feature]/
├── Controllers/
├── Services/         # ← Lógica de negocio
├── Requests/         # ← FormRequests
├── Models/           # ← Solo relaciones/scopes
├── Policies/
└── Views/

app/Shared/
├── Models/           # ← Models compartidos
├── Services/
├── Traits/
│   └── BelongsToTenant.php  # ← CRÍTICO
└── Scopes/
```

